<title>USA: Romac names Thomas Calcaterra CFO.</title>
<headline>Romac names Thomas Calcaterra CFO.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romac International Inc Friday named Thomas Calcaterra, formerly of Hydro Agri North American, as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Romac said Calcaterra replaces Peter Dominici, who became coporate vice president and treasurer responsible for investor and banking relations.</p>
